    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi na yaame waan nani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha, fagi waan jettu, wonti AABBO Waaqi guddaani jed'u, tana: Iyyi, lalabi waan jettu, guyyaani badi ya d'ufe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyyaani AABBO Waaqa ya d'iaate, guyyaani sunini guyya dumansa ka gosa ch'ufa balleesani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafasi woraani lafa Misiriti kae, badiini lafa Kushi qabati. Nama lafa Misiri heddu fit'ani, lafa worrale saamani balleesani ona tolchani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Had'iisa suni keesati askarti beeseeni lafa Kushitifi ta Putitiifi ta Luditifi ta Araftitifi ta Kubu iraa bitanifi ammalle ta gumi tiyya keesaa baatele ch'ufa infit'ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti AABBO Waaqi guddaani jed'u tana: Haga Migdoli ta mirgaati iti keeyatani, Aswani ta bitaati d'aabani, ch'ibraa lafa Misiri ch'ufa woraanaani hobaasani. Askarti Misiri ta ufi d'aadule imballeesani. Nami waan kana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti sunini lafa ch'ufa ira badde qulqullo ona taati. Dira isiile ch'ufa balleesani ona tolchani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa anini lafa Misiri ibadaani balleese ch'ibra isii ch'ufa hobaasani, worri gaafasi aka anini AABBO Waaqa beekha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja guyyaani sunini d'ufe Misiri balleesani, anini ergattu tiyya hobolooni erge, worra lafa Kushi ka dagu jiru naasise hiriba keesaa kaasa. Guyyaani sunini fago injiru ya walgenne!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'e, Anini harka hayyu Babiloni, ka Nebukadreza jed'aniini waan worri qabu ch'ufa balleesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaafi askartini isaa, ta naasu inqamneleeni, d'ufte lafa tana balleesani. Worri lafa Misiri goraadeeni had'e, lafa ch'ufa reefa namaatiini guuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini galaana Nile gosse, lafa Misiri harka worra ch'ubbu qabuti kenne nami gosa d'ibileeni lafa suni ch'ufa had'e balleesa. Nami dubbi tana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'u, Anini waan harkaani boch'ani waaqa tolfatanifi waaqa d'ara ka Memfesile imballeesa. Ammalle nama Misiri mohatu deebiani inargani, anini lafa suni ch'ufa keesa nama sodaachise mudamsiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini lafa Pathrosi ta bita balleese ona tolche, dira Soani ka mirgale gube, daara baasa. Ammalle dira gudda No jed'ani balleese, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dira Misiri, ka Sini jed'ani, ka aka jaba jaarani, dallansu tiyyaani balleesa. Anini hori dira Nole balleese, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lafa Misiri ch'ufa ibida iti kaye worra sunile aka male lalefachisa. Naabo Soani ch'absani dira suni ch'ufa bisaani iti baafatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaimi dira Onitifi ka Pibesethi woraanaani hobae, jara kaani d'ibile boojiani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini humna Misiri, ta isiini d'aabbatte taani ch'absinaani lafti Tapanesi dukanoofti. Ammalle dumansi lafa Misiri d'osse, nama dira isii keesa tau ch'ufale boojiani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa anini lafa Misiri kara kanani balleesu, worri aka anini AABBO Waaqa beekha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka jabeenna hayyu Misiri ch'absani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya torbeeso, ka jia qara, ka ganna kud'ani tokeeso, ka nu haga nu boojiani teenne, AABBO Waaqi na yaame waan nani jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namicha, anini yayu harka hayyu Misiri ch'ach'abse, nami tokoleeni ka ch'aba suni isaa mare hid'e akasiini inni fayye harka sunini deebie goraade qabatu injiru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma tana duuba wonti anini, AABBO Waaqi guddaani, jed'u tana: Anini yayu hayyu Misiriti nyaape; anini harka isaa lachu, ka qara ch'abeefi ka inch'abinile, ch'abse goraade harka isaa keesaa buusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle anini worra Misiri lafa ch'ufa keesati firfirse, harka hayyu Babiloni jabeese, goraade tiyya harka isaa keesa kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle anini harka hayyu Misiri ch'abse, duuba inni aka hama madae, laalefate ooe, nyaapa isaa durati dua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, anini isa laafise hayyu Babiloni jabeesa. Hojja anini goraade tiyya harka isaa kenne, inni Misiriti fuula deebisu, nami ch'ufti yo suni aka anini AABBO Waaqa beekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle anini worra Misiri lafa ch'ufa keesati firfirsa, duuba akanaani worri aka anini AABBO Waaqa beekha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka lafa Misiritiifi mukha hind'eesa wolifakeesani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
